  "text": "STORE\nCOMMUNITY\nABOUT\nSUPPORT\nInstall Steam sign in  |  language\nStore Page\n[WoG] War of Genesis: Idle Loot\nAll\nDiscussions\nScreenshots\nArtwork\nBroadcasts\nVideos\nNews\nGuides\nReviews\n[WoG] War of Genesis: Idle Loot > General Discussions > Topic Details\nTheDarkQueeN\nSep 12 @ 5:59pm\nDouble purchase issue and account blocking\nI returned an item due to a duplicate purchase issue, and as a result, my account was blocked. I contacted the authorities via Gmail for help, but unfortunately, they weren't very helpful and only responded with automated messages. Please unblock my account. Why was it blocked when it wasn't our fault?\nShowing 1-1 of 1 comments\n76561198381382310\nSep 14 @ 12:30pm \nwell in their case refunding is your fault. korean games tend to ban people that refund to prevent further refunds (dirty i know) this is also because there are chinese providers that sell cash currency for extremely cheap which leads to the chinese refunding\n\n(so it's a scam followed up by a ban xD) happens alot even in western mobile games.\n\nfor future reference NEVER spend money on a ripoff of another game (reskinned low budget ai slop) this will be a common issue double purchase (refund to fix yourself? oops ban)\n\nyou're not the only one, there are atleast hundreds of players that quit because of this, it's very unlikely to be addressed as the company is quite shady but i hope for the best, Good Luck!\nLast edited by Kiri; Sep 14 @ 12:30pm\n#1\nShowing 1-1 of 1 comments\nPer page:\n15\n30\n50\n\n\n[WoG] War of Genesis: Idle Loot > General Discussions > Topic Details\nDate Posted: Sep 12 @ 5:59pm\nPosts: 1\n Discussions Rules and Guidelines\nMore discussions\n 0\n有沒有各職業配點的攻略網站\n 1\n市集購買後遊戲信箱卻沒東西可以領\n 1\nUnable to Access Steam Community Market After Adding Funds – Verification Error\n 1\nauto translate of chat\n\n© 2026 Valve Corporation. All rights reserved. All trademarks are property of their respective owners in the US and other countries.\nVAT included in all prices where applicable.\n\nSTEAM\nAbout Steam\nSteam SSA\nSteamworks\nSteam Distribution\nGift Cards\nVALVE\nAbout Valve\nJobs\nHardware\nRecycling\nLEGAL\nPrivacy\nAccessibility\nNotices & Policies\nCookies\nRefunds\nMORE\nGet Steam\nGet Mobile Apps\nGet Support\nMy Account",
